title The Sample page: a loop's end moved while it sounds, Slice, Warp and Grain on one sound, Sample Recall, and Edit pad
covers sample-live-loop, sample-warp, grain-movement, grain-cloud-view, grain-presets, sample-edit-pad
# Plays whatever sound the kit has on the pad the Sample page opens on (the
# stick's kits differ), so the checks name no sound. Every edit stays in the
# run's RAM-only library; UNDO takes the edits back at the end.
wait 1
mark sounds
pad 1 100 0.5
pad 2 100 0.5
pad 3 100 0.5
button PLAY
pad 1 100
wait 0.5
pad 3 100
wait 0.5
pad 1 100
wait 0.5
pad 3 100
wait 2
mark loop
tap header tab Sample
tap smp-region choice Mode: Loop
tap smp-region choice Loop: Forward
pad-down 1 100
wait 0.5
qlink 2 -5
qlink 2 -5
wait 0.5
qlink 2 +10
wait 0.5
pad-up 1
tap smp-region choice Loop: Ping-pong
pad 1 100 1.5
tap smp-region choice Loop: Off
# A turn's line is written as the next edit starts.
expect : End 
tap smp-region choice Mode: One shot
mark slice
tap smp-tools tool Slice
tap smp-region more Method ›
tap smp-region more Slice ›
pad 1 100 0.5
tap smp-region less Method ‹
mark warp
tap smp-tools tool Warp
tap smp-region choice Warp: Stretch
pad 1 100 1.5
tap smp-region more Warp tempo ›
pad 1 100 1.5
expect sample: stretched
tap smp-region choice Warp: Repitch
pad 1 100 1.5
tap smp-region choice Warp: Off
mark grain
tap smp-tools tool Grain
tap smp-region choice Grain: Grains
pad-down 1 100
qlink 1 +8
wait 1
qlink 4 +4
wait 1
qlink 4 -4
wait 1
pad-up 1
tap smp-region choice Grain: Grain LFO
expect : pitch +0 st -> +4 st
pad 1 100 2
tap smp-region choice Grain: Presets
pad 1 100 2
mark recall
# The last bars the master played become a new sound: on the MPC this keeps
# what the pads just played; the tests' session keeps no master and says so.
tap smp-recorder keep Keep last 4 bars
wait 2
mark undo
button UNDO
button UNDO
button UNDO
button UNDO
expect sample: undo in kit
mark edit-pad
# The pad's own page (the MPC's PROG EDIT) is on the Pads tab: from its row,
# then from PROG EDIT, back to the pads each time.
tap header tab Pads
tap smp-pads-list button layers, keys, scenes, slices ›
expect sample: Edit pad on pad
tap smp-play-bar back ‹ Pads
expect sample: Edit pad closed: the pads again
mark prog-edit
button PROG EDIT
wait 0.5
button PROG EDIT
wait 0.5
expect sample: Edit pad on pad
expect sample: Edit pad closed: the pads again
tap header tab Play
button STOP
button STOP
expect STOP: transport stopped
